Apple has published a <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Spb-ka7xrR8">new ad</a> to appeal to customers who prioritize privacy when browsing, suggesting that Safari is the one you should use if you want to "Keep data trackers off your back."<br/>
<br/>
